 umbling detective\, casts his wife and kids in it\, and tries to juggle hi
 s two worlds. Q&A with creator Gregg Lachow. $13 ($10 Students & Seniors)\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-uncertain-detective-season-
